Some icons (file-bazel, file-c, file-cpp, file-Csharp, file-h, file-jupyter, file-swiftLang)
carry no per-file header; they come from the same Apache 2.0 source tree.

Brand logos among them (Docker, Terraform, GraphQL, Groovy, Jupyter, Microsoft Windows, Perl,
Swift, C#, Bazel) are trademarks of their respective owners. The Apache 2.0 license grants
no trademark rights (section 6); review their use before distributing IVE publicly.

terminal.svg, warning.svg, locate.svg, arrow-up.svg, arrow-down.svg and rollback.svg (dark/ and light/) are not
from the IntelliJ set: they were drawn for IVE in the same style.

restart.svg (dark/ and light/) is modified: the arrow of run/widget/restart.svg, cut at the bottom right
and coloured like the other icons, with the run triangle of run/rerun.svg (Apache 2.0, section 4(b)).

branch-main.svg (dark/ and light/) is modified: branch.svg with nodes/star.svg, scaled down, in its empty lower
right corner (Apache 2.0, section 4(b)).

folder-run.svg (dark/ and light/) is modified: the folder of nodes/module.svg, its corner badge replaced by a
small run triangle coloured as run/run.svg (Apache 2.0, section 4(b)).
